      "english": "One day, Little Ming's mother was in the kitchen cooking, and his father stood beside her constantly nagging."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "一会说“火太大了，关小点儿”，一会又说“盐放多啦，肯定很咸”……   ",
      "traditional": "一會說“火太大了，關小點兒”，一會又說“鹽放多啦，肯定很鹹”……   ",
      "pinyin": "yí huì shuō huǒ tài dà le guān xiǎo diǎn'r yí huì yòu shuō yán fàng duō la kěn dìng hěn xián",
      "english": "One moment he says “You put too much oil!”, and the next moment he says “Hurry and put the fish in the pot!”."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "One moment he says “The flame is too big, turn it down a bit!”, and then “Don't put so much salt, it'll be too salty!”."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妈妈听得不耐烦了，说：“我知道怎么炒菜，你赶紧出去！”",
