      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba xiào le shuō",
      "english": "The mother can't bear it anymore and says: “I know how to cook! Get out of here now!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“我只是想让你知道，当我开车的时候，你在我旁边喋喋不休，我是什么样的感觉！”",
