    "sentence_translations": [
      "Don't Nag",
      "",
      "One day, Little Ming's mother was in the kitchen cooking, and his father stood beside her constantly nagging.",
      "One moment he says “You put too much oil!”, and the next moment he says “Hurry and put the fish in the pot!”.",
      "One moment he says “The flame is too big, turn it down a bit!”, and then “Don't put so much salt, it'll be too salty!”.",
      "",
      "The mother can't bear it anymore and says: “I know how to cook! Get out of here now!”",
      "Little Ming's father smiles and says:",
      "“I just wanted to let you know how I feel when you sit next to me jabbering while I drive!”"
    ]
  }
